  triage:closeNote "AK6-QA-2: CURL_BINARY const wrapper introduced at c61f5c77; the exact original lint enforcement mechanism could not be textually pinned by req-qa (no process_spawn tag on this crate's io_forbidden list, no clippy.toml workspace-wide), but Just lint passes cleanly on all 3 platforms (ubuntu/macos/windows) at ac306cd9 — direct evidence the concern no longer trips any active gate. Closing on CI evidence." ;
